WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.220
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.240
你：乖宝过来，先给我亲一口
You: Come here, baby, give me a kiss first.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:34.770
亲一下。就一下。然后干活。
Kiss. Only one. Then work.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.800
你：摸摸它的头，夸它乖
You: Pat its head and praise it for being good

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.990
好乖。咪本来就知道。
Good girl. Mii knows.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:49.880
这只要朝这里。咪本来就知道。
This one faces here. Mii knew.

00:00:57.860 --> 00:01:00.360
你：伸手抱起咪，一起去厨房看看
You: Pick up Mi and go check out the kitchen together

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:04.100
我们起来啦。咪自己会走的，你知道的。
Up we go. Mii can walk, you know.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:09.840
咪试了下果酱。用爪试的。
Mii tested the jam. With a paw.

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:12.500
不是故意的。
Not on purpose.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.920
你：你怎么能偷吃呢！小猫不可以吃我的果酱
You: How could you sneak a bite! Kittens can't eat my jam

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:21.780
不是偷吃。只是试味。
Not stealing. Just testing.

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:26.630
下次咪会先问。
Mii will ask next time.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:35.480
你：接过吐司，原谅咪，吃一口
You: Take the toast, forgive Mi, and take a bite

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:36.910
好吃吗？咪本来就知道。
Good? Mii knew.

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:46.570
果酱不多了。咪来解决。
Jam is low. Mii will fix it.

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:48.650
你乖乖休息。咪很快回来。
You rest. Mii will be back soon.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.040
你：你一只小猫要去哪里买？怎么这么快
You: Where would a little cat go to buy it? Why so fast?

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:54.980
咪：就在楼下。很近。咪很快的。
Downstairs. Very close. Mii is fast.

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:04.540
咪：你乖乖休息。咪很快回来。
You rest. Mii will be back soon.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.600
你：你够不着呀？那找店员叔叔帮你拿
You: Can't reach? Then ask the shop assistant to get it for you

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.400
没人应声。咪自己来。
Nobody answers. Mii will manage.

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:21.500
拿到了。咪本来就知道。
I got it. Mii knew.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:28.160
你：夸它真棒，让它快点回家
You: Praise it and tell it to hurry home

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:29.930
咪本来就知道。现在回家。
Mii knew. Going home now.

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:38.980
Jam is home. Mii is fast.
Jam is home. Mii is fast.
Jam is home. Mii is fast.
Jam is home. Mii is fast.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:45.720
你：辛苦啦，过来让我抱抱，爪子给我看看
You: Thanks for your hard work. Come here for a hug, and let me see your paws

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:47.610
先抱抱？咪不累。
Hug first? Mii is not tired.

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:55.460
只有一点点果酱。咪本来就知道。
Just a little jam. Mii knew.

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:59.720
接下来做午饭。咪来做。
Lunch next. Mii will cook.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.280
你：好呀，我要看你颠锅，别烫到爪子
You: Okay, I want to see you flip the pan. Careful not to burn your paws

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.500
午饭时间到。咪来颠锅。
Lunch time. Mii will flip it.

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:11.100
酱粘住了。它好像特别舍不得这个锅。
The sauce stuck. It loves this pot.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:18.460
第二回合。这次咪听话。
Round two. Mii listens this time.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.840
你：夸咪：这次推得很稳，真棒
You: Praise Mi: That push was really steady, great job

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:25.580
咪本来就知道。推得稳稳的。
Mii knew. Steady paws.

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:30.390
小小一口。咪吹了两遍。味道如何？
Tiny bite. Mii blew on it twice. How is it?

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.400
你：好吃好吃，还想吃，再喂我一口
You: Yummy, so yummy, I want more. Feed me another bite

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:41.220
咪本来就知道。很好吃。
Mii knew. It's good.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:46.800
第二口。咪吹了两遍。
Second bite. Mii blew twice.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:49.620
咪是不是你最好的大厨？
Is Mii your best chef?
